  "boundary": "Exact static identities and module/token joins under selected native hashes. Direct selected source order gives structural-only finite framing. Outer inline header12 ends with an independently bounded target after a real raw12 cursor advance. Nested header18 and header7 preserve every source member and independent curve/payload length. Curve header3 reads raw8, signed nullable count and raw28 elements without element headers. Count bounds precede multiplication or iteration. MOVSS source helper consumes four bytes; preserve arbitrary bits without float meaning. The hidden 32-byte return buffer belongs to a provider bridge and does not establish source width: header7 is a conditional concrete wrapper profile, not raw32. Both header7 nested contexts independently join the same AnimationCurve type. Null wrappers and null/empty curve arrays stay distinct. Output setters, constructors and output offsets add no source bytes. Live provider/adapter selection, full allocation/refill/error parity, curve field meanings, camera behavior and whole-BuffData EOF remain unresolved."
